      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, what do you mean by \"a slow-moving goblin\" or \"as green as a goblin's heart\"? I'm just looking for soil science advice. Can you just give me the technical breakdown of the N-P-K ratios for those two options and how they actually affect the pH levels?",
